<!--
  Happy Birthday to You
  Tune of "Good Morning to All" by Mildred J. Hill (1893), traditional words. Public domain.
  C major, 3/4, quarter = 100, pickup + 8 bars (15 s). Right hand: the melody, G3-G4.
  Left hand: one note per bar, C3 D3 F3. D3 stands for the G chord, because the melody
  itself plays G3. Every note is in C3-B4.

  bar | right hand  | left hand | words
    0 | G3 G3       | -         | Hap-py
    1 | A3 G3 C4    | C3        | birth-day to
    2 | B3 G3 G3    | D3        | you, hap-py
    3 | A3 G3 D4    | D3        | birth-day to
    4 | C4 G3 G3    | C3        | you, hap-py
    5 | G4 E4 C4    | C3        | birth-day dear
    6 | B3 A3 F4 F4 | F3        | (name), hap-py
    7 | E4 C4 D4    | C3 D3     | birth-day to
    8 | C4          | C3        | you!
-->
